<h1>Your stamped PDFs are ready!</h1>

<p>Hi there,</p>

<p>Your stamped PDFs for <strong><%= @product.name %></strong> are now ready for download. The PDFs have been personalized with your purchase information.</p>

<p>You can download your files by clicking the links below, or visit your download page:</p>

<p><a href="<%= url_redirect_download_page_url(@url_redirect.token) %>" style="background-color: #36a2eb; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;">Download Your Files</a></p>

<% if @stamped_pdfs.any? %>
  <h3>Your stamped PDFs:</h3>
  <ul>
    <% @stamped_pdfs.each do |stamped_pdf| %>
      <li><%= stamped_pdf.product_file.s3_filename %></li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
<% end %>

<p>Thank you for your purchase!</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>
<%= @product.user.display_name %></p>
